@startuml
!pragma layout smetana

title Internal machine: the operational spine

skinparam state {
    BackgroundColor #D6E8FA
    BorderColor #4A78A8
    FontColor #1A1A1E
    AttributeFontColor #3A3A3E
    ArrowColor #4A78A8
    ArrowFontColor #1A1A1E
    StartColor #4A78A8
    EndColor #4A78A8
}
skinparam note {
    BackgroundColor #FBF3D3
    BorderColor #C9A227
    FontColor #1A1A1E
}
skinparam BackgroundColor white
skinparam DefaultFontColor #1A1A1E

state "booked" as Booked
state "verified" as Verified
state "live" as Live
state "expired" as Expired
state "cancelled" as Cancelled #E8D9F0 ##[bold]7A4B93

Booked : Recorded in our books
Verified : Our record matches the execution
Live : Contributing to risk and P&L
Expired : Contract ceased naturally
Cancelled : Removed from the book

[*] --> Booked : Book
Booked --> Verified : Verify
Verified --> Live : Confirm
Verified --> Live : Activate
Live --> Expired : Expire / Mature / Exercise
Booked --> Cancelled : Cancel
Verified --> Cancelled : Cancel
Live --> Cancelled : Cancel / Terminate
Expired --> [*]
Cancelled --> [*]

note right of Verified
  An unverified trade is an
  internal control exception.
end note

note bottom of Live
  Two events reach Live. Confirm, for a
  trade whose terms a counterparty agrees.
  Activate, for one with nobody to agree
  with. The machine does not know which
  kind of trade it carries.
end note

note right of Cancelled
  Shared state. Cancel is
  broadcast to both machines
  and terminates each.
end note

@enduml
